        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur business is you. \r\n\r\n3 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom Mid Terrace Home \r\nNon-designated parking to the front of the property\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and  are delighted to present 8 Hampton Wood to the Balbriggan property market.\r\nWelcome to No. 8 Hampton Woods, a bright and inviting three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace residence ideally located within a quiet and established residential development in the popular coastal town of Balbriggan.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front. Stepping inside, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming entrance hallway. To the left is the kitchen and dining area, positioned to the front of the property and featuring a recently updated kitchen, providing an ideal space for everyday family life and entertaining. Moving through the property, there is a convenient guest WC located beneath the stairs.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the spacious living room is filled with natural light thanks to the large windows, while a feature fireplace creates an attractive focal point. The living area also provides direct access to the low-maintenance rear garden, offering an excellent space for relaxing, entertaining and enjoying family time outdoors. The garden also includes a useful shed which has been plumbed and fitted with electricity, providing potential for use as a dedicated laundry or utility space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including the main bedroom which benefits from built-in wardrobes. Additional storage is available on the landing, while the family bathroom completes the accommodation on this level.\r\n\r\nHampton Woods is a quiet and convenient residential development located close to Balbriggan town centre and its excellent range of local amenities. A variety of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities are all within easy reach, while the area is also well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools. Balbriggan Beach and Harbour are nearby, offering residents the opportunity to enjoy the town's attractive coastal setting.\r\n\r\nThe property is also ideally positioned for commuters, with Balbriggan Train Station and regular bus services providing convenient access towards Dublin City and beyond. The nearby M1 motorway also offers excellent connectivity to Dublin Airport, the city centre and the wider national road network.\r\n\r\nNo. 8 Hampton Woods offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-located family home in a quiet residential setting, with the added benefit of off-street parking, a low-maintenance rear garden and excellent access to schools, shops, transport links and the many amenities Balbriggan has to offer.\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have ***"
      },
